'''CLIFF NOTES:'''
# Use Sage's Stone at every opportunity, even if your party is at full health
# Have Terry equip the Hela's Armour if the party is at, or close to, full health.  It will drop his Agility to 0, and guarantee he goes after Mortamor.
# Have Terry ''remove'' the Hela's Armour if the party is hurt.  The Meteorite Bracer will max out his Agility, and ensure he goes before Mortamor.
# Swap everyone out except one character out any time Mortamor ends his turn with "Bounce", "Disruptive Wave", or "Venom Mist".  Otherwise, you might eat two AoEs in a row.
# Use Antidotal Herbs or Squelch if you are envenomed.
# This form is practically immune to Knuckle Sandwich.  Don't use it.

