# Raise everyone's Defense as high as you can via Buff & Kabuff.
# Buff & Oomph signal that he's entered Pattern B.
# Mortamor will cast Buff & Oomph on himself, even when it's useless to do so.
# Beware if Mortamor ends a turn with Buff or Oomph.  It means a potential double AoE turn.
# On the flip side, be grateful if he ends a turn with Scorching Flames.  It means he can only attack you with Mercurial Thrust or Roundhouse Kick.
# If on the SNES version, Carver should stay away from Focus Strength + Hela's Hammer.  A bug makes it so Oomph + Focus Strength + Hela's Hammer will overflow; causing it to wrap around to single or double digit damage, instead of what it should be.
# Keep track of Mortamor's HP.  You don't want to be injured walking into Round 3.

